==Description==
'''Flex''' is a sticker given to every player for free. It can also theoretically be bought in the [[Daily Store]] for {{Coins|200}}, though as it is given for free to new players, this is essentially impossible to do.

==Appearance==
The sticker showcases a muscular arm with a yellow skin color and red sleeve with a lighter red outline flexing. A sound of a groan along with a muscle flexing sound will play when used.

==Trivia==
*The description for this sticker is an old phrase used to call out major successes.
*The sleeve design is similar to the sleeve design of the Default [[Minigunner]].

